  unitName: General Weiss
  unitId: 40024
  unitNumber: 323
  description: A tactician from the ruined Atharva Republic. Just as Lucius was reaching
    out to help, Weiss enacted his final end strategy. He used himself as a decoy
    so that others could escape. Despite there being no hope for reinforcements,
    with renewed morale his men followed his every word. Just as his people had escaped
    and he and his men were on the verge of defeat, legend has it that he said, "In
    the end, I guess we won."
  summonDesc: Meeting me changes how people think.<br>Surely this power will benefit
    you<br>more than me, will it not?
  fusionDesc: There's no room in war for a<br>general who neglects resources.<br>Soldiers
    require support.
  evoDesc: You mustn't have fear.<br>Plans hatched out of fear are<br>easily read
    by the enemy.
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
